Table 1 Weight of Evidence Summary. The underlying questions for the content of table: Dose-response: Does the empirical evidence support that a change in KEup leads to an appropriate change in KEdown?; Temporality: Does KEup occur at lower doses and earlier time points than KE down and is the incidence of KEup &gt; than that for KEdown?; Incidence: Is there higher incidence of KEup than of KEdown?; Inconsistencies/Uncertainties: Are there inconsistencies in empirical support across taxa, species and stressors that don&rsquo;t align with expected pattern for hypothesized AOP?
