			+
			
			
			&nbsp;
			
		
		
			
			0.5-5 &micro;M, ex vivo, mouse fetal liver HSC concentration1
			
			
			+++

			(inference from MLL cleavage)
			
			
			+

			(only MLL cleavage)
			
			
			-

			(no leukemia development)
			
		
		
			
			max 5 &micro;M, ex vivo, mouse fetal liver HSC concentration1
			
			
