Nguyen, D. H., H. A. Oketch-Rabah, et al. (2011). &quot;Radiation acts on the microenvironment to affect breast carcinogenesis by distinct mechanisms that decrease cancer latency and affect tumor type.&quot; Cancer Cell 19(5): 640-651.

