""" ;
	nci:C25725	"""The roles of RALDH play in sensory perception of fish mating opportunities via their presence in the visual functions. Significantly, the AO (population decline) can apply to IATA by dysfunction of the retinoid in reproduction in the aquatic environment. It&nbsp;can be applied to retinoid effects on a central nervous system within the OECD EDTA
""" ;
	dc:creator	"""Cho,Kichul (kichul.cho@mabik.re.kr&nbsp;)

Environmental Safety Group, Korea Institute of Science and Technology (KIST) Europe, Campus E 7.1, 66123 Saarbruecken, Germany

