""" ;
	dcterms:abstract	"""This AOP is designed to detect changes in cumulative fecundity and egg production resulted from the inhibition of LHR by its antagonisms. Alteration of fecundity and ovulation in fish is the critical endpoint for reproductive toxicity caused by endocrine disrupting chemicals. This endpoint is essential and useful for screening of the potential endocrine disrupting chemicals and/or risk assessment. Therefore, this AOP can be applied to the prediction of reproductive toxicity caused by the inhibition of LHR.
""" ;
	dcterms:license	<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/> ;
	aopo:has_key_event	aop.events:1692, aop.events:1693, aop.events:1694, aop.events:1695, aop.events:1696, aop.events:1691, aop.events:679 ;
