	dc:title	"SARS-CoV-2 spike protein binding to ACE2 receptors expressed on pericytes leads to endothelial cell dysfunction, microvascular injury and myocardial infarction. " ;
	dcterms:alternative	"Pericytes possess a key role in the heart injury by COVID-19." ;
