	aopo:AopContext	"""Sex:The AOP is appicable to women.However study suggests that the relative risk of breast cancer in men is comparable to that in women for alcohol intakes below 60 g per day. It continues to increase at high consumption levels not usually studied in women (Gu&eacute;nel P et al 2004).&nbsp;

Life stage:There are no research articles which highlight the role alcohol in a particular life stage.In addition, age-related differences in response to alcohol exposure are neither uniform nor linear. The data available is insufficient which direct the construction of a catalog of &ldquo;appropriate&rdquo; tests or to define all the factors which influence nonlinear effects (Squeglia LM&nbsp; et al 2014). 

Taxonomic:The evidences for the key events of this AOP are available in various species ike rat,mice and humans.
