	dc:title	"AhR activation in the thyroid leading to Subsequent Adverse Neurodevelopmental Outcomes in Mammals" ;
	dcterms:alternative	"AhR activation in the thyroid leading to Adverse Neurodevelopmental Outcomes in Mammals" ;
