Table 1 Summary of the chosen methods to measure the PPAR&gamma; activation.
""" ;
	nci:C25664	"""Molecular""" ;
	nci:C17469	"""PPAR&gamma; have been identified in frog (Xenopus laevis), mouse, human, rat, fish, hamster and chicken (Wahli &amp; Desvergne, 1999).
""" ;
