	dc:title	"Binding to ACE2" ;
	dcterms:alternative	"Binding to ACE2" ;
	dc:source	"AOPWiki" ;
	dc:description	"""Angiotensin-converting enzyme 2 (ACE2) is an enzyme that can be found either attached to the membrane of the cells (mACE2) in many tissues and in a soluble form form (sACE2). 

A table on ACE2 expression levels according to tissues (Kim et al.)


	
		
			
			&nbsp;
			
			
			Sample size
			
			
			ACE2 mean expression
			
			
			Standard deviation of expression
			
		
		
			
			Intestine
			
			
