""" ;
	nci:C25664	"""Cellular""" ;
	nci:C17469	"""Chemicals: This KE applies to a wide range of chemicals.&nbsp; The chemicals generate a reactive species, such as reactive oxygen species, following absorption of photon energy from light within the range of natural sunlight (290-700 nm) (ICH, 2014, Onoue and Tsuda, 2006).



Sex: This KE applies to both males and females.&nbsp;

Life stages: The relevant life stages for this KE are all life stages after born.

