				O&rsquo;Neill RE, Jaskunas R, Blobel G, Palese P, Moroianu J. Nuclear import of influenza virus RNA can be mediated by viral nucleoprotein and transport factors required for protein import.&nbsp;J Biol Chem&nbsp;(1995) 270:22701&ndash;4. doi:10.1074/jbc.270.39.22701
			

