				Lai JC, Chan WW, Kien F, Nicholls JM, Peiris JS, Garcia JM. Formation of virus-like particles from human cell lines exclusively expressing influenza neuraminidase. J Gen Virol (2010) 91:2322&ndash;30. 10.1099/vir.0.019935-0
			

			&nbsp;
			
		
		
			
			Electron microscopy
			
			
