			Salama et al., 2012
			
			
			In vivo

			Rotenone 3mg/kg/d
			
			
			&nbsp;
			
		
		
			
			Myeloperoxidase

			(HOCl from H2O2)

			Resveratrol decreased NO, ROS, phagocytosis in microglia and astrocytes
			
			
