			MPP+

			5,10,20 microM
			
			
			&nbsp;
			
		
		
			
			Pharmacological inhibition or deletion of CD95 in peripheral myeloid cells 

			(monocytes, macrophages, microglia, leucocytes) hampered infiltration in the brain of peripheral myeloid cells
			
			
