	nci:C71478	"""No uncertainties, since a decrease in protection against oxidative stress leads, by definition, to an increase in oxidative stress
""" ;
	nci:C17469	"""The link between decrease in antioxidant protection and induction of oxidative stress can be found in Zebrafish, rodents (mouse and rat) and in man, but may not be restricted to these species.
""" ;
