	nci:C71478	"""No uncertainty or inconsistency reported yet.
""" ;
	nci:C17469	"""Support for the link between glutamate dyshomeostasis and cell injury /death can be found in rats, and mouse. However, as the neurotransmitter glutamate is already found in insects, it is plausible that this KER is valid throughout taxa (Harris et al., 2014).
""" ;
