			&nbsp;
			
			
			testosterone production reduction, testosterone levels, reduction (testicular and whole-body T levels in fetal and neonatal male rats from GD 17 to PND 2. (Parks, 2000)
			
		
		
			
			Phthalate (MEHP)
			
			
