			&nbsp;
			
			(Andrade et al. 2006)
			
		
		
			
			Phthalates

			(DEHP)
			
			
			rat
			
			
			LOEL=1.215 mg /kg bw/day
			
			
			Decreased testosterone levels
			
			
			Effects on Sperm production
			
			&nbsp;
			
			(Andrade et al. 2006)
			
		
		
			&nbsp;
			&nbsp;
			&nbsp;
			&nbsp;
