	nci:C80263	"""The purpose of the Ca++ ATPase is to pump Ca++ out of the cell [1],[2]. When the ATPase is inhibited, this will lead to an overall increase (relative) of intracellular calcium.
""" ;
	dcterms:isPartOf	aop:26 .

