			10-13 DIV CGNs obtained from 8-day-old Sprague&ndash;Dawley rats
			
			
			0.1 to 30 &micro;M
			
			
			&nbsp;
			
			
			Time course (0 to 45 min)
			
			
			&nbsp;
			
			
