			Yes, intratracheal instillation of 54 and 162 &micro;g.
			
			
			Yes, increased plasma SAA3 after exposure to 162 &micro;g.
			
			
			(Gutierrez et al., 2023)
			
		
		
			
			Mouse
			
			
			Titanium dioxide
			
			
			Yes, intratracheal instillation of 162 &micro;g.
			
			
			Yes, increased plasma SAA3 and SAA1/2 after exposure to 162 &micro;g.
			
			
			(Gutierrez et al., 2023)
			
		
		
			
			Mouse
			
			
			Carbon black
			
			
			Yes, intratracheal instillation of 162 &micro;g.
			
			
			Yes, increased plasma SAA3 and SAA1/2 after exposure to 162 &micro;g.
			
			
			(Gutierrez et al., 2023)
			
		
		
			
			Mouse
			
			
			Singlewalled carbon nanotubes
			
			
			Yes, pharyngeal aspiration of 40 &micro;g.
			
			
			Yes, increase serum CRP, haptoglobin and SAP 1 day after exposure. 
			
			
			(Erdely et al., 2011)
			
		
		
			
			Mouse
			
			
			Multiwalled carbon nanotubes
			
			
			Yes, pharyngeal aspiration of 40 &micro;g.
			
			
			Yes, increase serum CRP, haptoglobin and SAP 1 day after exposure. No changes after 28 days.
			
			
			(Erdely et al., 2011)
			
		
		
			
			Mouse
			
			
