23&lt;/date&gt;&lt;/pub-dates&gt;&lt;/dates&gt;&lt;isbn&gt;1097-4172
(Electronic)&amp;#xD;0092-8674
(Linking)&lt;/isbn&gt;&lt;accession-num&gt;21183076&lt;/accession-num&gt;&lt;urls&gt;&lt;related-urls&gt;&lt;url&gt;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21183076&lt;/url&gt;&lt;/related-urls&gt;&lt;/urls&gt;&lt;custom2&gt;PMC3022472&lt;/custom2&gt;&lt;electronic-resource-num&gt;10.1016/j.cell.2010.11.034&lt;/electronic-resource-num&gt;&lt;/record&gt;&lt;/Cite&gt;&lt;/EndNote&gt;(Taelman et al., 2010). The Wnt ligand is antagonized with secreted Frizzled-related proteins (sFRPs) and Wnt inhibitory protein (WIF), both of which can bind Wnts and inhibit interactions between WNT and FZD  ADDIN EN.CITE  ADDIN EN.CITE.DATA 
 
(Bovolenta, Esteve, Ruiz, Cisneros, &amp; Lopez-Rios, 2008; Clevers &amp; Nusse, 2012)
 
. The Dickkopf 1 (DKK1) can disrupts Wnt-induced FZD-LRP6 complex formation  ADDIN EN.CITE  ADDIN EN.CITE.DATA 
 
(Clevers &amp; Nusse, 2012; Ellwanger et al., 2008; Semenov, Zhang, &amp; He, 2008)
 
.
""" ;
